<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-DRAW FOR FIRST AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DRAW FOR FIRST AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first African Champions' League kicks off in the third weekend of August with home games for the top seeds, Zamalek of Egypt and South Africa's Orlando Pirates, the Confederation of African Football (CAF) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The confederation drew Orlando Pirates in a four-club group A which also includes Primeiro de Agosto of Angola, U.S.M. Alger of Algeria and Raja of Morocco.</p>
<p>The three teams in group B with Zamalek are Obuasi Goldfields of Ghana, Ferroviario of Mozambique and Club Africain of Tunisia.</p>
<p>Draw for the competition (home team first):</p>
<p>August 22-23-24</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Raja</p>
<p>Zamalek v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Club Africain v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>September 5-6-7</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v Raja</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>Club Africain v Zamalek</p>
<p>September 19-20-21</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Raja v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Club Africain</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Zamalek</p>
<p>October 10-11-12</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Raja v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Zamalek</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Club Africain</p>
<p>October 24-25-26</p>
<p>Raja v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Zamalek v Club Africain</p>
<p>November 7-8-9</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v Raja</p>
<p>Club Africain v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Zamalek v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>November 28-29-30</p>
<p>Winner of group B v winner of group A</p>
<p>December 12-13-/14</p>
<p>Winner of group A v winner of group B</p>
